---
import Icon from "@components/Icon.astro";
import Brand from "@assets/images/Mekani.svg";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---
<footer class="flex justify-center bg-gray-900">

  <main class=" flex flex-wrap gap-10 my-10" style={{width:"70rem"}}>
      <section class="basis-full flex md:flex-nowrap flex-wrap gap-10 sm:px-10 px-5">
          <section class=" grow-0 shrink-0 md:basis-[10rem] basis-full flex justify-center items-center">
              <div class=" md:w-full w-[10rem]">
                  <div class="relative w-full aspect-square">
                      <Image src={Brand} alt="Creator's Logo" class="my-img" />
                  </div>
              </div>

          </section>
          <section class="flex-1 basis-full mr-auto">
              <h1 class="my-text-big mb-4 md:text-left text-center">Creator's Message</h1>
              <p class="text-justify my-subtext">
                Learning a new instrument is a long journey. We start with the essentials and gradually put them into practice. At some point, we all encounter music theory. <span id="more" class="hidden">With music theory, there are moments when we feel more like mathematicians than musicians. What we need is a tool to aid our memory in understanding these concepts. Forget about paper and pencils—Musifier is one of the tools that can support you on your musical journey.</span> <span id="more-less-button" class="underline underline-offset-2 font-normal cursor-pointer">more</span>
              </p>
          </section>

          <section class="flex-0 md:basis-auto basis-full">
              <h1 class="my-text-big mb-4 md:text-start text-center">Socials</h1>
              <div class="flex gap-5 md:justify-start justify-center">
                  <a class="block" target="_blank" href="https://www.fb.com/mekaniRxON">
                    <Icon name="facebook" inClass=" fill-gray-800" outClass=" w-8 h-8 p-1 my-btn" />
                  </a>
                  <a class="block" target="_blank" href="https://www.twitter.com/Mekani_Tekno">
                    <Icon name="twitter" inClass=" fill-gray-800" outClass=" w-8 h-8 p-1 my-btn" />
                  </a>
                  <a class="block" target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/@mekani_tekno">
                    <Icon name="youtube" inClass=" fill-gray-800" outClass=" w-8 h-8 p-1 my-btn" />
                  </a>
              </div>
          </section>
      </section>


      <section class="w-full">
          <p class="my-infotext text-center text-slate-500">&#169;Musifier x Mekani_Tekno 2024</p>
      </section>

  </main>


</footer>
<script>
//---Import

//---Const
const footerElement = document.querySelector("footer") as HTMLElement;
const moreElement = footerElement.querySelector("#more-less-button") as HTMLButtonElement;
const moreTextElement = footerElement.querySelector("#more") as HTMLElement;


//--- Functionality
function openMoreText(){
  moreTextElement.classList.remove("hidden");
  moreElement.textContent = "less";
}

function closeMoreText(){
  moreTextElement.classList.add("hidden");
  moreElement.textContent = "more";
}

//---> Listener
moreElement.addEventListener("click", function(){
  if(moreTextElement.classList.contains("hidden")){
    openMoreText();
  }else{
    closeMoreText();
  }
});
</script>